{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0103_1000_p", "source_sha256": "febf741d7d4a1dee756fba628f21b4aa50c0f8d88eb9c32cc53bffe7cf16d1ec", "ja": "（神社での初詣ライブは無事に成功！\nあとは、下山するだけなんだけど……）", "zh": "（在神社举办的年初参拜演唱会顺利成功！\n接下来只要下山就行了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0103_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "40fcbe86b7772fbb2b2fdb5b06090f484742b68df431d0510bc330f1f5fbd429", "ja": "うあうあ～。兄ちゃ～ん、真美、もうヘロヘロの\nクタクタだよ～。ふもとって、まだつかないのー？", "zh": "呜啊呜啊～大哥哥～\n真美已经累得惨兮兮了啦～山脚还没到吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0103_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7993c002c2799e3d5af45eedf690ed29ca10642751c0f65b9a89b2fd7600eb3e", "ja": "がんばれ真美、あとちょっとだ。", "zh": "加油啊，真美，就快到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0103_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "7a62c91dada0ff11e28a507df106718a76f411b830e7a9e2b156f61aa49b2e12", "ja": "え～、さっきもちょっとって言ってたのに～～！\n……あ！　じゃあ兄ちゃん、じゃんけんしようよ！", "zh": "咦～你刚刚也说快到了不是吗～～！\n……啊！不然这样吧，大哥哥我们来猜拳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0103_1004", "source_sha256": "3d00184e2ba1865bc43f30e2db8ee8a2216bd6b664cb3e6281994940ff634370", "ja": "しない", "zh": "不要", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0103_2000_p", "source_sha256": "5befa56a498044865a93090c81d0a3b2ca17cb173a79f844bf0f0499268670fb", "ja": "しないよ。負けたら、\nどうなるか分かったもんじゃないし。", "zh": "我不要。\n谁知道猜输了会有什么下场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0103_2001_012mam", "source_sha256": "c341f42e627d49b663c13deca535d71ab29ec59a70bf4d2cc8e31be0f1deca65", "ja": "では、分かるように説明しよう！\n兄ちゃんが負けたら、ここから真美をおんぶねっ！", "zh": "那就让真美解释给你听！\n如果大哥哥输了，就要从这里背真美下山！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0103_2002_012mam", "source_sha256": "412890db5564522c9f680361dca359222cd422b16f369fd8d4d44fc4466feaa8", "ja": "そんで兄ちゃんが勝ったら、ゴホウビタ～イム♪\n特別に、真美をおんぶさせて、あ・げ・るん♪", "zh": "如果大哥哥赢了，就是奖励时间～♪\n真美特别让你，背、下、山、唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0103_2003_p", "source_sha256": "a6360c8daaaff952248e029fcf2f84b8d4ee6d8bc15bb63ee8d1ba7a4bd12689", "ja": "……結局、同じじゃないか？", "zh": "……结果不都一样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0103_2004_012mam", "source_sha256": "ba301d28e42691e92f323b2e8baf9affeb219a919867d36b61b789b52cfe4a39", "ja": "わかってないな～！　つまり兄ちゃんは、\n勝っても負けても、おいしいってことなの！", "zh": "你不懂啦～！也就是说，\n不管大哥哥是输是赢，都赚到啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0103_2005_p", "source_sha256": "a44a1283755936f18f3804b6bc559caf88d3d93aee0f728a972d74e9cee887ec", "ja": "そうかなぁ……。それより、\nちゃんと前を向いて歩かないと危ないぞ。", "zh": "哪里赚到……先别胡闹了，\n走路要看前面，不然很危险的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0103_2006_012mam", "source_sha256": "a380234e2bfbe754c586941caec273d153674d6dad5d47ed78a345728f8349e5", "ja": "ええっ！？　こんなにせくしーあんどぷりちーな\n真美をおんぶできるチャンスなんだよ？", "zh": "咦！？这可是能背着性感又可爱的真美\n下山的大好机会耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0103_2007_012mam", "source_sha256": "677361f83b87a297b5a474cad84f548d9dfc6808f116a98c45c1ecace644a51b", "ja": "しかも！　今なら出血大サービスで、\nお姫様だっこも……って、うあうあ！", "zh": "而且！现在还加码大放送，\n让你用公主抱……哇，呜啊呜啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0103_2008_null", "source_sha256": "207c7e01228933441336cae15deeccf2fd1228fd6870491532d33366da906cca", "ja": "すってーん！", "zh": "（跌倒）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0103_2009_p", "source_sha256": "dddffa8ea5b6e7dd1133cd6d4f6f8e25b9c692d3ee06b1e7ad8474b791302b3f", "ja": "うわっ、言ってるそばから！\n真美、大丈夫か！？", "zh": "哇！我不是说了吗！？\n真美，没事吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0103_2010_012mam", "source_sha256": "f139952bb3cee8083a503515e1b290e3e185f25aa0c40dba3812db8e13a0363e", "ja": "いたた……。あはは、コケちった。", "zh": "痛痛痛……啊哈哈，跌倒了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0103_2011_p", "source_sha256": "26ab8260985dedf8c9074841c8e08d8e5b57e9803ad8179562c011af1e724e0f", "ja": "どこかケガしてないか？\n痛いところは？", "zh": "有没有受伤？\n会痛吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0103_2012_012mam", "source_sha256": "9c682df11c85f35d4a78055ee2f76f905ffc42f1d883bb16a1969bb14039e16c", "ja": "ん～……なんか、\nちょっと足をひねったっぽい……。", "zh": "嗯～\n脚好像有点扭到了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0103_2013_012mam", "source_sha256": "3dec0d60b8e55f7dc675ccf1fd4d27be290a2162905393afced7f96a0e9a71e3", "ja": "こうなったら、イタイのイタイの、\n兄ちゃんに飛んでけ～！", "zh": "既然如此，痛痛啊痛痛，\n飞去大哥哥身上吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0103_2014_p", "source_sha256": "8d2e24738d76c1f871b25b8565726eefcaa94ae705cad470f54f685e63cf226e", "ja": "本当に飛ばせるならいいんだけど。\n……ほら、俺の背中におぶさって。", "zh": "我倒希望真的能飞过来啊。\n……来，到我的背上吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0103_2015_012mam", "source_sha256": "6042971812a9edea94b54c35684a6fd219d4c54d1d55f3f84b32eea59dcde775", "ja": "へっ？　んっと……。\nいいの、兄ちゃん？", "zh": "咦？呃……\n可以吗？大哥哥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0103_2016_p", "source_sha256": "1442ec1c2e7b1d61952184b2b4c51f5c9b7b7e1312424e31fb134393a1bba3f9", "ja": "ああ、ちょっと揺れるかもしれないけどな。\nなんなら、じゃんけんするか？", "zh": "可以啊，只是可能会有点摇晃。\n还是你要猜拳决定？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0103_2017_012mam", "source_sha256": "0d7566cb0401c35e26ca1a5047ccc68b2bb5d87b43db8324c987dc367297db20", "ja": "あっ、ううん、いい……。えへへ。", "zh": "啊，不用了，这样就好……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
